{"headword":"יָתוֹם","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>orphan (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">יַתְמָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܝܰܬܡܳܐ</span>; Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">יתם</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">يَتِيمٌ</span> <em>pupil, orphan</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">יָתוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:21\" href=\"/Exodus.22.21\">Ex 22:21</a> + 29 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְתוֹמִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:23\" href=\"/Exodus.22.23\">23</a> + 8 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְתֹמֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.11\">Je 49:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְתֹמָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.16\">Is 9:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לִיתוֹמָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:12\" href=\"/Psalms.109.12\">ψ 109:12</a>;—<em>orphan</em>, i.e. fatherless (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמָנָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:23\" href=\"/Exodus.22.23\">Ex 22:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:9\" href=\"/Psalms.109.9\">ψ 109:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.3\">La 5:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין אָב</span>); <a data-ref=\"Job 24:9\" href=\"/Job.24.9\">Jb 24:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:12\" href=\"/Psalms.109.12\">ψ 109:12</a>; prob. also <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:21\" href=\"/Exodus.22.21\">Ex 22:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.18\">Dt 10:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.29\">14:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.11\">16:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.17\">24:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.12\">26:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.19\">27:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:6\" href=\"/Psalms.94.6\">ψ 94:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 146:9\" href=\"/Psalms.146.9\">146:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.6\">Je 7:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.3\">22:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 7:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.7.10\">Zc 7:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:5\" href=\"/Malachi.3.5\">Mal 3:5</a> (in all these, mentioned as helpless, exposed to injury, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמָנָה</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּר</span>); similarly, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמָנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:9\" href=\"/Job.22.9\">Jb 22:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:3\" href=\"/Job.24.3\">24:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 29:12\" href=\"/Job.29.12\">29:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:17\" href=\"/Job.31.17\">31:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:6\" href=\"/Psalms.68.6\">ψ 68:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.17\">Is 1:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.16\">9:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.2\">10:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.11\">Je 49:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.7\">Ez 22:7</a>; without <span dir=\"rtl\">אלמנה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 14:4\" href=\"/Hosea.14.4\">Ho 14:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:27\" href=\"/Job.6.27\">Jb 6:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:21\" href=\"/Job.31.21\">31:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:14\" href=\"/Psalms.10.14\">ψ 10:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:18\" href=\"/Psalms.10.18\">18</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.10\">Pr 23:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.28\">Je 5:28</a> (in no case clear that both parents are dead)."}]},"rid":"BDB04304","strong_numbers":["3490"],"next_hw":"יִתְמָה","p